(PROVINGTOWN HEALTH PLAN) Tj T*
(PHARMACY NETWORK AGREEMENT) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This Pharmacy Network Agreement \(the Agreement\) is entered into between) Tj T*
(Provingtown Health Plan, Inc. \(the Plan\) and the Pharmacy named on the signature page,) Tj T*
(and is administered on the Plan's behalf by Proving Benefit Managers LLC \(the PBM\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Term. This Agreement is effective January 1, 2026 and continues through December 31, 2026.) Tj T*
(It renews automatically for successive one-year terms unless either party gives written) Tj T*
(notice of non-renewal at least ninety \(90\) days before the end of the then-current term.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Network. The Pharmacy participates in the Provingtown Preferred Network. Claims are) Tj T*
(identified by BIN 999123, PCN PRVTEST and Group PROVE1. This Exhibit governs only) Tj T*
(pharmacies with PSAO chain code 605 or 630.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Pricing. Reimbursement for covered claims is set out in Exhibit B. All AWP references) Tj T*
(are to Medi-Span AWP as of the date of service.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. MAC appeals. The Pharmacy may appeal a MAC price within fourteen \(14\) days of the date of) Tj T*
(adjudication by submitting the claim number, NDC, date of service and a copy of the) Tj T*
(wholesaler invoice through the PBM's provider portal at https://appeals.proving.invalid.) Tj T*
(The PBM shall respond within seven \(7\) business days. An adjustment applies retroactively) Tj T*
(to the date of the appealed claim.) Tj T*
ET
