(EXHIBIT B  REIMBURSEMENT SCHEDULE) Tj T*
(Effective January 1, 2026. This Exhibit B supersedes Exhibit B dated January 1, 2025.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Provingtown Preferred Network, 1-34 day supply:) Tj T*
(Brand drugs: AWP minus 17.0% plus a dispensing fee of $1.50 per claim.) Tj T*
(Generic drugs: the lesser of MAC or AWP minus 45.0%, plus a dispensing fee of $2.00 per claim.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Provingtown Preferred Network, 35-90 day supply:) Tj T*
(Brand drugs: AWP minus 18.0% plus a dispensing fee of $1.00 per claim.) Tj T*
(Generic drugs: the lesser of MAC or AWP minus 47.0%, plus a dispensing fee of $1.00 per claim.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Generic Effective Rate. The PBM guarantees an aggregate Generic Effective Rate of AWP minus) Tj T*
(84.0% measured across all participating pharmacies over each calendar year and reconciled) Tj T*
(by the Plan by March 31 of the following year. This guarantee is not a per-claim rate.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Network Performance Fee. A fee of 3.0% of ingredient cost is assessed each quarter on all) Tj T*
(claims where the Pharmacy's generic dispensing rate for the quarter is below 85%, and is) Tj T*
(collected by offset against the next remittance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Payment. The Plan pays clean claims by EFT twice monthly and provides an electronic) Tj T*
(remittance advice \(835\). EFT and ERA enrollment changes are made on the PBM's provider) Tj T*
(portal. Questions on payment go to payments@proving.invalid.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Disputes. A remittance not disputed within sixty \(60\) days of the remittance date is deemed) Tj T*
(accepted.) Tj T*
ET
